listing:   firmware_v2.elf
toolchain: lldb version 18.1.3; QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   qemu-system-arm -M stm32vldiscovery -S -gdb (unix socket) -kernel firmware_v2.elf; lldb-18 --batch: process connect, register read sp pc, memory read 0x0, image lookup
date:      2026-10-09T19:30:32Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
hardware:  untested on hardware; run in QEMU's emulated STM32F100 board, not on a real chip; the host gdb in the container is x86-only, so LLDB 18 spoke the GDB remote protocol
